{
  "_comment": [
    "Canonical resume section names mapped to every heading variant seen in",
    "the wild. Used by app/core/segment.py.",
    "",
    "Matching is case-insensitive and punctuation-insensitive: a heading line",
    "is normalised (lowercased, non-alphanumerics collapsed to single spaces)",
    "before lookup, so 'WORK EXPERIENCE:' and 'Work-Experience' both resolve.",
    "",
    "To add a variant, put it under the canonical key it belongs to. Keep",
    "variants lowercase and singular/plural as they actually appear."
  ],

